message: "If you use this artifact, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "AcaTime CISS-2026 artifact: rule-aware incremental evaluation and validation logs"
abstract: >-
  Exact AcaTime genetic-algorithm source snapshot, local runner, public ITC 2019
  bridge tools, and 17 anonymized faculty-scale validation runs with sanitized
  logs and aggregate checks. Raw faculty data, schedules and production logs are
  not included.
